	<TextRow
		Label="msg_r13r0201_infomationw_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>イッシュで　いちばん　ながい　みち
それが　１３ばんどうろ　とのことです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:25:05" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>イッシュで　一番　長い　道
それが　１３番道路　とのことです</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-30T07:25:25" />
